	// HYPOTHESIS-3: Direct override to w0=0.85 for sessions with long prefixes (>=128) preserves multiturn cache reuse without depending on base weight multiplication
	// MECHANISM-3: Multi-turn sessions with long prefixes save significant recomputation; direct high affinity weight avoids dilution from SLO adjustments
	// EXPECT-3: multiturn_e2e_ms < 165

